= render 'shared/fun_stuff_page', page_title: 'Problem Solver', current_page: 'Problem Solver', page_subtitle: 'Interactive troubleshooting for common display issues', document_title: 'Problem Solver - Fun Stuff', meta: ['Coming soon', 'Troubleshooting', 'Interactive help'] do
  p.lead A guided troubleshooting tool is on the way — for now, start with board FAQs and support.

  .prose
    .callout.info
      span.ic
        svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
          circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
          path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
      div
        span.lbl Work in progress
        p.bd We're building an interactive problem solver. Until then, these paths cover most issues.

    .next-grid
      = link_to fun_stuff_faq_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind FAQ
          span.go →
        h4 Fun Stuff FAQ
        p General questions about setup, compatibility and troubleshooting.
      = link_to support_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Support
          span.go →
        h4 Support hub
        p Hardware support, asking for help and community links.
      = link_to boards_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Docs
          span.go →
        h4 Board FAQs
        p Per-board frequently asked questions and manuals.
      = link_to fun_stuff_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Index
          span.go →
        h4 All fun stuff
        p Back to downloads, release notes and the rest.

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Stuck on something specific?
    p Tell us what the board is doing — we'll point you at the right doc.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to support_asking_for_help_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Asking for help
        span.ar →
      = link_to fun_stuff_faq_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | Read the FAQ
